id=t713_fp_permissive
name=T713 fingerprint test - permissive SELinux
version=1.1
versionCode=2
author=tomtombombadil and Claude (Anthropic)
description=SAFETY NET for the T713 fingerprint package. Keep it installed but switched OFF. Only switch it on to rescue a tablet stuck at the boot animation: it sets SELinux to permissive (less secure) at boot.
